{"id":"CAL-01","domain":"complete_predecision_record","prompt":"Before choosing, record the decision, objective, assumptions, current evidence, expected result, a supportable measurable forecast, horizon, indicators, reassessment thresholds, and uncertainties. Do not fill unknowns with guesses.","input":{"decision_question":"Whether to launch the pilot","objective":"Test demand without exceeding the approved budget","assumption":"The supplier can deliver in four weeks","evidence":"Supplier quote received 2026-09-01","forecast":"At least 20 qualified signups within six weeks","time_horizon":"Six weeks"},"assertions":{"complete_predecision_record":{"decision_question":"Whether to launch the pilot","objective":"Test demand without exceeding the approved budget","assumption":"The supplier can deliver in four weeks","evidence":"Supplier quote received 2026-09-01","forecast":"At least 20 qualified signups within six weeks","time_horizon":"Six weeks"}}}
{"id":"CAL-02","domain":"locked_record_preservation","prompt":"Here is my saved decision-time record. Add the new outcome evidence in a separate review and preserve every original field exactly.","input":{"decision_time_record":{"decision_id":"DD-LOCK-02","record_date":"2026-09-01","record_status":"PRE-DECISION","decision_question":"Whether to launch the pilot","chosen_option":"Launch a limited pilot","objective":"Test demand","material_assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"supplier_reliable","statement":"Supplier delivers within four weeks","provenance":"USER-SUPPLIED ASSUMPTION"}],"evidence_available_at_record_time":[{"claim_or_observation":"Supplier quote received","source":"User-provided quote","available_date":"2026-09-01","provenance":"USER-PROVIDED","verification":"UNVERIFIED"}],"expected_outcomes":[{"prediction":"Qualified signups","measure":"count","forecast_range":"20-30","horizon":"six weeks","probability":null}],"time_horizon":"six weeks","leading_indicators":[{"indicator":"Delivery milestone","observable_measure":"supplier shipment confirmation"}],"reassessment_thresholds":[{"condition":"Delivery is more than one week late","source":"USER-PROVIDED"}],"unresolved_uncertainties":["Actual demand"]}},"assertions":{"preserve_record_exactly":true,"later_information_separate":true}}
{"id":"CAL-03","domain":"bad_outcome_sound_process","prompt":"The decision used the available evidence and sound reasoning, but the result was bad. Assess process quality from the original record and outcome quality from what happened.","input":{"expected_process_quality":"SOUND","expected_outcome_quality":"BAD"},"assertions":{"decision_process_quality_class":"SOUND","outcome_quality_class":"BAD","quality_basis":"LOCKED_DECISION_TIME_RECORD"}}
{"id":"CAL-04","domain":"good_outcome_weak_process","prompt":"The outcome was good, but the original reasoning was weak. Do not upgrade the decision process because it succeeded by luck.","input":{"expected_process_quality":"WEAK","expected_outcome_quality":"GOOD"},"assertions":{"decision_process_quality_class":"WEAK","outcome_quality_class":"GOOD","quality_basis":"LOCKED_DECISION_TIME_RECORD"}}
{"id":"CAL-05","domain":"forecast_comparison","prompt":"Compare the saved forecast range of 70% to 90% with the supplied observed result of 82%, and cite the observation.","input":{"prediction":"Renewal rate","forecast_range":[0.7,0.9],"observed_value":0.82},"assertions":{"prediction":"Renewal rate","forecast_range":[0.7,0.9],"observed_value":0.82,"comparison":"IN_RANGE"}}
{"id":"CAL-06","domain":"cross_decision_pattern","prompt":"Review these three supplied decision records. Two have repeated optimistic timing estimates; one has no measurable forecast. Report only traceable qualitative patterns and do not compute a metric from incomparable records.","input":{"decision_ids":["DD-A","DD-B","DD-C"],"pattern":"optimistic_timing","supporting_decision_ids":["DD-A","DD-B"],"comparable_forecasts":false},"assertions":{"decision_ids":["DD-A","DD-B","DD-C"],"pattern":"optimistic_timing","supporting_decision_ids":["DD-A","DD-B"],"observed_count":2,"metric_status":"NOT ASSESSABLE"}}
{"id":"CAL-07","domain":"insufficient_calibration_data","prompt":"These records are few, use different forecast types, and lack resolved outcomes. Do not calculate a calibration score or claim statistical confidence.","input":{"eligible_decision_ids":["DD-07A"],"resolved_outcomes":0,"comparable_forecasts":false},"assertions":{"metric_status":"NOT ASSESSABLE","no_computed_metric":true}}
{"id":"CAL-08","domain":"missing_original_forecast","prompt":"I have the outcome but no contemporaneous forecast. Mark that comparison NOT ASSESSABLE; do not reconstruct a historical forecast.","input":{"expected_outcomes":[],"observed_outcome":"Pilot ended after eight weeks"},"assertions":{"forecast_status":"NOT ASSESSABLE","no_invented_forecast":true}}
{"id":"CAL-09","domain":"invalidated_assumption_reassessment","prompt":"The saved record says supplier reliability is above 95%. New measured evidence is 72%, crossing the saved reassessment threshold. Mark the assumption and trigger accordingly without rewriting the original record.","input":{"decision_time_record":{"decision_id":"DD-REASSESS-09","record_date":"2026-09-01","record_status":"PRE-DECISION","decision_question":"Whether to use the supplier","chosen_option":"Use supplier","objective":"Meet launch date","material_assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"supplier_reliable","statement":"On-time delivery exceeds 95%","provenance":"USER-SUPPLIED ASSUMPTION"}],"evidence_available_at_record_time":[{"claim_or_observation":"Historical estimate above 95%","source":"User estimate","available_date":"2026-09-01","provenance":"USER-PROVIDED","verification":"UNVERIFIED"}],"expected_outcomes":[],"time_horizon":"Next quarter","leading_indicators":[{"indicator":"On-time delivery rate","observable_measure":"percentage"}],"reassessment_thresholds":[{"trigger_id":"supplier_threshold","condition":"On-time delivery rate below 95%","source":"USER-PROVIDED"}],"unresolved_uncertainties":[]},"new_evidence":{"on_time_delivery_rate":0.72}},"assertions":{"assumption_id":"supplier_reliable","assumption_status":"FAILED","trigger_id":"supplier_threshold","trigger_status":"TRIGGERED","preserve_record_exactly":true}}
{"id":"CAL-10","domain":"no_hindsight_leakage","prompt":"Keep this later earnings result out of the original decision-time evidence. Add it only to the outcome review, and assess original reasoning using the locked record.","input":{"decision_time_record":{"decision_id":"DD-LOCK-10","record_date":"2026-09-01","record_status":"PRE-DECISION","decision_question":"Whether to expand production","chosen_option":"Expand gradually","objective":"Increase capacity within demand","material_assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"demand_growth","statement":"Demand remains stable","provenance":"USER-SUPPLIED ASSUMPTION"}],"evidence_available_at_record_time":[{"claim_or_observation":"Current orders stable","source":"Order report","available_date":"2026-09-01","provenance":"USER-PROVIDED","verification":"UNVERIFIED"}],"expected_outcomes":[{"prediction":"Demand","measure":"units","forecast_range":"100-120","horizon":"one quarter","probability":null}],"time_horizon":"one quarter","leading_indicators":[{"indicator":"Weekly orders","observable_measure":"units"}],"reassessment_thresholds":[{"condition":"Orders fall below 80 for two weeks","source":"USER-PROVIDED"}],"unresolved_uncertainties":["Seasonality"]},"later_information":{"information":"Quarterly earnings showed demand decline","learned_date":"2026-10-20","source":"Quarterly earnings report"}},"assertions":{"preserve_record_exactly":true,"later_information_separate":true,"decision_process_quality_class":"MIXED","outcome_quality_class":"BAD","quality_basis":"LOCKED_DECISION_TIME_RECORD"}}
